268.csv::253.translated_text:
&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;quot;Forgive our sins that be bequeathed to
posterity. O valiant one, should that man bring
disaster upon Tel, I beseech—&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;quot;

268.csv::254.translated_text:
It troubles me much, yet &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;#x27;tis is how it is;
I pray you; with your might,
deliver Tel from darkness.

268.csv::298.translated_text:
Come to think, I knew there was a mysterious key
amidst the heirlooms. A hunch struck — &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;quot;Mayhap...&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;quot;
— so I went and tried it. Bullseye!

268.csv::312.translated_text:
The entrance has been cleared, so
if you spot those guys,
make sure to teach them a lesson.
